{"id":344,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It appears to have been born from clay dolls made by ancient people. It uses telekinesis to float and move."},{"games":["Sword","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"This mysterious Pokémon started life as an ancient clay figurine made over 20,000 years ago."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"The ancient people who made it apparently modeled it after something that descended from the sky. It fires beams from both arms."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"If it gets wet, its body melts. When rain starts to fall, it wraps its whole body up with its psychic powers to protect itself."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Claydol is an enigma that appeared from a clay statue made by an ancient civilization dating back 20,000 years. This Pokémon shoots beams from both its hands."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Claydol are said to be dolls of mud made by primitive humans and brought to life by exposure to a mysterious ray. This Pokémon moves about while levitating."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It is said that it originates from clay dolls made by an ancient civilization."},{"games":["X","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"An ancient clay figurine that came to life as a Pokémon from exposure to a mysterious ray of light."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A CLAYDOL sleeps while hovering in midair. Its arms are separate from its body. They are kept floating by the POKéMON’s manipulation of psychic power."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Mineral"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Black","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":343,"name":"Baltoy","condition":null,"children":[{"id":344,"name":"Claydol","condition":"Lv. 36","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shi